  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pumpin' 4 the Man**: back after 37 archived shows (401 days) [3]\n- **Flies On My Dick**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **hours 45 minutes 24 seconds of live Ween**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-05-25.shn** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 166 min [1]. Said about its sound: Audio quality is average, needing EQ, and is neither the worst nor best Ween recording [1]\n- **06-track-06_20200827_1614**: source not stated; 25 songs; 167 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The group performed many early songs from the Quebec album during the show [1]\n- The concert took place on the outdoor stage at The Stone Pony in Asbury Park [2]",
